Hey there, long time no see I guess.

This patch brings:
* Minor bugfixes;
* Few more tries to optimize the game even more;
* A trading NPC for Sell / Buy / Trade various items;
* Vlad Roszkovan got a new option in his social tab;
* Few more new items;
* Added animations for crafting and such;
* Other small changes.

My list continues for the following updates with some more polishing / bug-fixing of what was found last time and what will be found after new testing.

You can now find Ravensthorn on X @ https://x.com/ravensthorngame?s=21

Have a good one!

Last for today unless I'll find something game-breaking. Might aswell be the last update for the following week as I feel that burnout coming after me.

* Few hot-fixes;
* Tweaks regarding view distance / map quality;
* Added Fabric, Empty Jar, Metal Debris, Silk Fabric, Puff, Kositor, Quicksilver to loot tables.

- Currently either the % on which Metal Debris is looted from Ore Veins is broken, or it's overriden by the Ore drop. Until further notice, rely on looting treasures for a chance to get Metal Debris. If someone wants test that if Ore Veins actually do drop Metal Debris please confirm on Discord @ [url=https://discord.gg/5U6HqGMgja]https://discord.gg/5U6HqGMgja[/url]

Take care!

